She didn’t realize she was just being played by the media.%NIt was honestly sad...
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002E7E)
【七海】
“Anyway, this isn’t about Gero Froggy!”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002E8E)
【七海】
“C’mon, let’s go buy you a phone already.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002E9E)
【七海】
