<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002EAE)
【七海】
“And you’re the only one in our family that doesn’t have one.”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002EBE)
【拓巳】
“I-I don’t want one...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F0E)
【七海】
“B-But why?! Dad’s even paying for it!”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F1E)
【拓巳】
“I just... don’t need it...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F2E)
It would be a nuisance, if anything.
<LINE>
If I had a phone, Mom would definitely call every day.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F3E)
And if I kept ignoring those calls, they’d keep sending%N*Little Miss Assassin* Nanami over here to lay on the pressure.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F4E)
My family life would become even *more* of a living hell, and I’d%Nhave to start being way more careful as a result.
<LINE>
I couldn’t let that happen.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00002F96)
【七海】
