<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003084)
She’d never acted like this before. Why did she suddenly want me to walk her to the station? What was so special about today?
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003094)
【七海】
“It’s really dangerous out there! Y’know, with all the murders and%Nstuff?! As my older brother, you should at least be a *little*%Nconcerned about me, right?!”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000030A4)
【拓巳】
“...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000030B4)
Yesterday’s events were resurrected in my mind once again, if only%Nfor a second.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000030C4)
【拓巳】
“N-Not really...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $000030D4)
Either way, it wasn’t like the New Gen murderer was twisted enough%Nto attack some brat like Nanami... Nobody would want to get near%Nsomebody who smelled like piss like she did.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003114)
【七海】
“I-I don’t believe it...”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003154)
【七海】
“Are you saying you wouldn’t even care if I died...?”
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003164)
Nanami was tearing up.%NIt seemed like my words had really gotten to her.
<END>

#WRITE(PTR, $00003174)
Fuhihi, serves you right. Maybe you should think twice about%Ndisturbing my peace and quiet next time. This is just my own way of taking a little revenge for once. Get fucked.
<END>

